
state
  suffix: "Part"

beat Main
  Before all.
  beat("SubOne")
  beat("Sub" + suffix, "gold")
  After all.

beat SubOne
  Inside sub one.

beat SubPart(metal)
  Inside sub part with $metal.

/*
<test>
- expected: |
    ~ Before all.

    ~ Inside sub one.

    ~ Inside sub part with gold.

    ~ After all.
</test>
*/
